  "body": "Crafted, Not Just Constructed. Experience the Difference.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 14 Kiri Place, an exclusive collection of just four architecturally designed brand-new homes, ideally positioned in the sought-after Mairangi Bay and Windsor Park neighbourhood. Combining contemporary architecture, premium finishes and thoughtful design, these beautiful homes offer the perfect balance of style, comfort and functionality.\r\n\r\nEducation Excellence – Rangitoto College Zone\r\n\r\nA major attraction for families is the highly sought-after Rangitoto College school zone. Renowned for its strong academic focus, diverse curriculum and extensive sporting, cultural and extracurricular opportunities, Rangitoto College is one of New Zealand's most recognised secondary schools, offering both NCEA and International Baccalaureate pathways.\r\n\r\nAn excellent opportunity for families looking to secure a quality new home while enjoying the benefits of an established and desirable education zone.\r\n\r\nDesigned for Modern Living\r\nEach home offers:\r\n• Four generously proportioned bedrooms\r\n• Two stylish, fully tiled bathrooms,plus a guest toilet downstairs\r\n• Internal-access garage\r\n• Designer kitchen with premium appliances and elegant stone benchtops\r\n• Spacious open-plan living and dining\r\n• Expansive outdoor decking for relaxation and entertaining\r\n\r\nPremium Features You'll Love\r\n• Freehold title – no body corporate fees\r\n• Underfloor heating for year-round comfort\r\n• Designer bathrooms with creative lighting art deco\r\n• Air conditioning in living areas and master bedrooms\r\n• Abundant natural light and contemporary interiors\r\n\r\nLocation, Location, Location!\r\n\r\nEnjoy peaceful cul-de-sac living with convenient access to Constellation Drive motorway connections, local shopping centres, cafés, restaurants, beautiful beaches and everyday amenities.A wonderful combination of modern living, quality craftsmanship, convenience and sought-after schooling.\r\n\r\nDon't settle for the standard. Elevate your lifestyle. Own something exceptional!",
